5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I believe we should examine the readmission figures during the call-back trial and the visit completion on the shared nursing round to see what actually works.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I will look into rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, as well as what the booking system records, to assess our current capacity.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I'll examine the board minutes on a jointly run clinic and the data agreements with outside surgeries to see where previous collaborations may have faltered.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'll check the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, and the therapy and midwifery staffing review, because I'm worried about how our staff will handle more work!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I shall look into this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location to ensure our chosen path is financially sustainable.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
