34,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The call-back trial showed a significant drop in readmissions for elderly patients, but the shared nursing round struggled with a high rate of missed visits.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Our facilities are strained; rooms and parking are nearly full by mid-morning, and the booking system fails to record any activity that doesn't have a fixed appointment slot.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It appears that joint ventures are precarious; one such clinic collapsed because neither department would take ownership of the budget or the rota, and external data agreements are agonizingly slow to finalize.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"The ward nursing vacancies are quite high and agency costs are rising, but interestingly, the midwifery rota actually has some unusual slack due to falling birth numbers.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The budget is tighter than expected, with floor space costs now deducted from it, and we must note that off-site contacts bring in no regional fund tariffs.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, if off-site visits bring no revenue and the budget is shrinking, we must be very careful about proposing any program that relies on home visits.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, I agree. Furthermore, if the booking system cannot track non-appointment work, any program without fixed slots will effectively become invisible in our activity reports.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, your mention of slack in the midwifery rota is intriguing, though we must be wary of the ownership issues I found in the board minutes regarding joint clinics.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, I understand the risk, but if the midwifery team has the capacity, maybe they would be more willing to take ownership this time?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Servas,,It is heartening to see such thoughtful collaboration. We must balance the needs of our patients with the reality of our resources to ensure the program we choose can truly flourish.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, given the parking and room shortages you mentioned, any program requiring significant on-site patient traffic might be impractical regardless of its clinical merit.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Toshio,,Exactly. We need a solution that doesn't exacerbate the congestion in our outpatient areas or rely on a booking system that cannot account for the actual workload.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, that logic is sound. If we avoid both the administrative void of non-appointment work and the physical bottleneck of the car park, our options narrow significantly.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"I just want to make sure we don't put too much pressure on the ward nurses, since they are already struggling with so many vacancies and agency staff.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Your concern for our colleagues is a virtue, Yumi. We must seek a path that supports our patients without breaking the spirits of those who care for them.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Asuka,,We should prioritize a program that utilizes existing slack in staffing and avoids the pitfalls of off-site funding or on-site congestion.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"I agree. We need a program that is administratively visible, physically feasible within our current space, and doesn't rely on external funding that isn't there.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we are converging on a set of strict criteria. We need a program that is internally manageable, avoids the bureaucratic nightmare of external data agreements, and doesn't vanish from the ledger.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"I hope we can find something that helps the patients but also makes the staff's lives a little easier, especially since some teams have more room to help than others!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Servas,,Wisdom often reveals itself when we look at the gaps in our current system. Let us now see which candidates align with these truths we have uncovered together.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,,status,Servas,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
