59,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Looking at the candidates, the Perinatal Support Service seems most viable as it utilizes the midwifery slack Yumi found and avoids the off-site funding issues Servas mentioned.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with Asuka. The Perinatal Support Service uses fixed consultations, which fits our booking system, and avoids the parking congestion that a larger Day Rehabilitation Unit would cause.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The Perinatal Support Service is a strong contender, provided we avoid the joint-ownership pitfalls I noted; however, Chronic Care Coordination seems too reliant on those slow external data agreements.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"I love the Perinatal Support Service idea! It uses the midwifery team's extra time and helps new parents, which is so wonderful, and it won't overwhelm the ward nurses.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a gentle and promising path. By utilizing existing capacity and remaining within our financial means, we ensure the program's longevity rather than a fleeting success.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, since the Perinatal Support Service is a joint effort between midwifery and pediatrics, how can we ensure we don't repeat the budget and rota failures you discovered in the board minutes?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"Perhaps we can establish a clear, single point of accountability for the budget from the start, rather than leaving it to a vague joint agreement.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, that is precisely the solution. If we designate a lead department for the budget line and rota, we eliminate the ambiguity that killed the previous joint clinic.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"That sounds like a great plan! If we make it clear who is in charge of what, the midwifery and pediatric teams can just focus on helping the families.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Servas,,"Clarity in responsibility is the seed from which stability grows. When every hand knows its task, the burden becomes light for all, and the program can truly serve the community.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"I am satisfied with this approach. The Perinatal Support Service aligns with our staffing capacity, financial constraints, and administrative needs while avoiding the risks we identified.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I concur. It is the only option that doesn't risk seizing up our physical infrastructure or disappearing from our activity reports.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I agree. Given the constraints we've discussed, it is the most rational choice, provided we implement the accountability measures we just agreed upon.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'm all for it! It's a wonderful way to use our resources to help people, and I'm happy we're thinking about the staff too!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Servas,,It is a rare and beautiful thing when logic and compassion align so perfectly. I believe we have found a path that is both sustainable and kind.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I vote for the Perinatal Support Service.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I vote for the Perinatal Support Service.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,I vote for the Perinatal Support Service.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Yumi,,I vote for the Perinatal Support Service!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Servas,,I also cast my vote for the Perinatal Support Service.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
